  offerLine: Um. Sorry. Hello. I don't want to be any trouble. It's just that it smells nice. I'll just watch. Is that all right? Maybe... a few dishes? I'll stay over here.
  activeLine: No rush! Sorry. Sorry to ask. It smells lovely.
  readyLine: I've been watching, and I think you're kind. That's all. Sorry. Here. It's not much.
  doneLine: You could call me Peka. If you want.
